cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Programmazione dinamica: online lecture notes with worked exercises"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes of the Programmazione dinamica course — the principles of dynamic
  programming and DP algorithms for knapsack problems (0/1, unbounded, bounded,
  subset sum, multiple-choice, multidimensional, with setups, multiple
  knapsack), lot sizing, coin change and rod cutting — with definitions,
  results and proofs, worked examples, exercises with solutions and
  interactive apps.
authors:
